# characterization baseline: 25-one-throw-strands-rest-of-batch
# A single unparseable `la` throws mid-frame, and the per-frame catch returns out of processInboxBatch from inside the loop -- abandoning every LATER frame in the same claimed batch holding its claim token. Found by the property suite (seed 1001); the 24 single-frame cases could not see it.
# documents: docs/known-issues.md#14-one-malformed-frame-strands-the-rest-of-its-batch, tests/property/README.md#what-it-found
#
# Masked values: <CLOCK> clock-derived datetime, <TOKEN> in-flight
# claim token, [PID] worker process id.

